<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's D&amp;S started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's D&amp;S started as buy.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santander Investment has started its coverage of supermarket chain D&amp;S with a buy rating, citing the company's expansion plans in Chile and Argentina.</p>
<p>&quot;Among its Chilean peers, we believe that D&amp;S has the strongest competitive strategy, given its three supermarket formats that are clearly designed to reach all consumer segments,&quot; said Santander in a report.</p>
<p>D&amp;S operates the Almac, Ekono and Lider chains of stores.</p>
<p>Santander said it set a 12-18 month target price of 590 pesos per share, a rise of 19 percent on current levels.</p>
<p>((-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
</text>
